<title>ITALY: Italy's total reserves 114.721 trln lire in Oct.</title>
<headline>Italy's total reserves 114.721 trln lire in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's total reserves stood at 114.721 trillion lire at end-October, the Italian Exchange Office said in a statement.</p>
<p>The office gave the following data in trillions of lire:</p>
<p>				     Oct 96	Sept 96	Oct 95</p>
<p>    Total reserves	    114.721	111.417	90.487</p>
<p>    Total assets		116.531	113.165	94.731</p>
<p>     (of which in gold)	38.723	 38.723	41.524</p>
<p>    Liabilities		   1.810	  1.748	 4.244</p>
<p>    (of which short-term)     0.270	  0.204	 2.569</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
